  "post_content": "<p>El Ayuntamiento de Tales est&aacute; ejecutando las obras de repavimentaci&oacute;n de la calle Morera, &ldquo;una actuaci&oacute;n muy demandada por el vecindario&rdquo;, seg&uacute;n indica el alcalde, Ambrosio Ram&iacute;rez G&oacute;mez.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/02/IMG_8803.jpg\" style=\"height: 320px; width: 480px\" /><br />\n Las obras consisten en la sustituci&oacute;n de los antiguos adoquines, que causaban desniveles en el vial, por un pavimento m&aacute;s plano. Tambi&eacute;n se cambiar&aacute;n las trapas de hormig&oacute;n de agua potable y alcantarillado en cada vivienda por otras de hierro fundido.</p>\n<p><br />\n &nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/obrescarrermoreratales/img_8765.jpg\" alt=\"img_8765\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/obrescarrermoreratales/img_8770.jpg\" alt=\"img_8770\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/obrescarrermoreratales/img_8774.jpg\" alt=\"img_8774\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/obrescarrermoreratales/img_8777.jpg\" alt=\"img_8777\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/obrescarrermoreratales/img_8779.jpg\" alt=\"img_8779\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/obrescarrermoreratales/img_8781.jpg\" alt=\"img_8781\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/obrescarrermoreratales/img_8783.jpg\" alt=\"img_8783\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/obrescarrermoreratales/img_8785.jpg\" alt=\"img_8785\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/obrescarrermoreratales/img_8786.jpg\" alt=\"img_8786\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/obrescarrermoreratales/img_8789.jpg\" alt=\"img_8789\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/obrescarrermoreratales/img_8792.jpg\" alt=\"img_8792\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/obrescarrermoreratales/img_8795.jpg\" alt=\"img_8795\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/obrescarrermoreratales/img_8799.jpg\" alt=\"img_8799\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/obrescarrermoreratales/img_8802.jpg\" alt=\"img_8802\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/obrescarrermoreratales/img_8803.jpg\" alt=\"img_8803\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/obrescarrermoreratales/img_8805.jpg\" alt=\"img_8805\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
